# Line endings are LF everywhere, including on Windows checkouts.
#
# Two things in this repository compare file contents byte for byte: the
# generated composer page, which CI regenerates and diffs, and the golden
# statusline the render tests assert against. With git's default behaviour a
# Windows checkout rewrites those files to CRLF and both comparisons fail for
# a reason that has nothing to do with the code (Principle IX).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
